#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud Resource Controller REST API to get, list, update, and create IBM Quantum Compute Service instances."
msgstr "Gunakan IBM Cloud Resource Controller REST API untuk mendapatkan, mendaftar, memperbarui, dan membuat instance IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Resource Controller API for instance management"
msgstr "Menggunakan IBM Cloud Resource Controller API untuk manajemen instance"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Abluemix, apikey */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Resource Controller API for instance management {#use-ibm-cloud-resource-controller-api-for-instance-management}"
msgstr "Menggunakan IBM Cloud Resource Controller API untuk manajemen instance {#use-ibm-cloud-resource-controller-api-for-instance-management}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller REST API to programmatically get, create, and update [instances](/guides/instances). \n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller REST API untuk secara terprogram mendapatkan, membuat, dan memperbarui [instance](/guides/instances). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Resource Controller endpoints require that you authenticate by passing a header called `Authorization` with the bearer token. Refer to the [REST API setup guide](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
msgstr "Semua endpoint Resource Controller mengharuskan kamu untuk melakukan autentikasi dengan meneruskan header bernama `Authorization` dengan bearer token. Lihat [panduan setup REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get an instance {#get-an-instance}"
msgstr "Mendapatkan sebuah instance {#get-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`GET /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance) endpoint to get information about a particular instance. The [CRN](/guides/instances) must be URL-encoded in the path.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan endpoint [`GET /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance) untuk mendapatkan informasi tentang instance tertentu. [CRN](/guides/instances) harus di-URL-encode dalam path.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the standard Resource Controller fields, the response includes quantum-specific fields in both `parameters` and `extensions`. `extensions` stores the instance's normalized metadata, whereas `parameters` only stores the most recent request to modify the instance. Therefore, you should read from `extensions` rather than `parameters`.\n"
msgstr "Selain field standar Resource Controller, respons mencakup field khusus kuantum di `parameters` dan `extensions`. `extensions` menyimpan metadata instance yang sudah dinormalisasi, sedangkan `parameters` hanya menyimpan permintaan terbaru untuk mengubah instance. Oleh karena itu, kamu sebaiknya membaca dari `extensions`, bukan dari `parameters`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `extensions` object includes these fields:\n"
msgstr "Objek `extensions` mencakup field berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`instance_limit_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The usage time limit for the instance. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"
msgstr "`instance_limit_seconds` — Integer, atau `null`. Batas waktu penggunaan untuk instance. Lihat [Menetapkan batas alokasi instance](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The time allocated to this instance, used by the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) to determine queue priority. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"
msgstr "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, atau `null`. Waktu yang dialokasikan untuk instance ini, digunakan oleh [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) untuk menentukan prioritas antrean. Lihat [Menetapkan batas alokasi instance](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backends` — Array of strings. The allowlist of backend names available to this instance. `[\"ANY\"]` means all backends on the plan are available (the default). `[]` means no backends are available.\n"
msgstr "`backends` — Array berisi string. Daftar izin nama Backend yang tersedia untuk instance ini. `[\"ANY\"]` berarti semua Backend pada paket tersedia (default). `[]` berarti tidak ada Backend yang tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"The backends field may be outdated\">\n"
"  The `backends` field in the `extensions` object may be outdated. This can happen when IBM Quantum Support changes your account in a way that impacts instances. For example, when a backend is removed from an account, it will update the `backends` for the instance, but that change is currently not yet reflected in the Resource Controller API.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Field backends mungkin sudah usang\">\n"
"  Field `backends` pada objek `extensions` mungkin sudah usang. Ini bisa terjadi ketika IBM Quantum Support mengubah akunmu dengan cara yang memengaruhi instance. Misalnya, ketika sebuah Backend dihapus dari akun, ini akan memperbarui `backends` untuk instance tersebut, tetapi perubahan itu saat ini belum tercermin di Resource Controller API.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Instead, the current workaround is to use the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) with the [`GET /v1/backends`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/backends#tags__backends__operations__list_backends) endpoint. (Make sure that you set the `Service-CRN` header to your instance's CRN.)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sebagai gantinya, solusi sementara saat ini adalah menggunakan [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) dengan endpoint [`GET /v1/backends`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/backends#tags__backends__operations__list_backends). (Pastikan kamu menetapkan header `Service-CRN` ke CRN instance-mu.)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"    The CRN must be URL-encoded in the path. Replace each `:` with `%3A` and each `/` with `%2F`. For example, `crn:v1:bluemix:...` becomes `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"    CRN harus di-URL-encode dalam path. Ganti setiap `:` dengan `%3A` dan setiap `/` dengan `%2F`. Misalnya, `crn:v1:bluemix:...` menjadi `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request GET \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import urllib.parse\n"
"    import requests\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
"    # We use urllib.parse.quote to URL-encode the CRN.\n"
"    url = (\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"        + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
"    # We use urllib.parse.quote to URL-encode the CRN.\n"
"    url = (\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"        + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
"    )\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.get(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"},\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.get(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"},\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get a list of all instances {#get-a-list-of-all-instances}"
msgstr "Mendapatkan daftar semua instance {#get-a-list-of-all-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`GET /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances) endpoint to get a list of all your instances. Set the `resource_id` query parameter to `b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f` to filter to IBM Quantum&reg; instances.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan endpoint [`GET /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances) untuk mendapatkan daftar semua instance-mu. Tetapkan parameter kueri `resource_id` ke `b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f` untuk menyaring instance IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account has multiple plans and you want to filter by plan, set the `resource_plan_id` query parameter to one of the following values:\n"
msgstr "Jika akunmu memiliki beberapa paket dan kamu ingin menyaring berdasarkan paket, tetapkan parameter kueri `resource_plan_id` ke salah satu nilai berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Plan | `resource_plan_id` |\n"
"|------|---------------------|\n"
"| Premium | `7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc` |\n"
"| Flex | `53bde9d3-cdbb-46f5-a98f-60ebcadf7260` |\n"
"| Pay-As-You-Go | `5304b575-3cff-4455-90dc-ae4367762093` |\n"
"| Open | `850b21a7-71de-4e53-9441-1abdd202f35d` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Paket | `resource_plan_id` |\n"
"|------|---------------------|\n"
"| Premium | `7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc` |\n"
"| Flex | `53bde9d3-cdbb-46f5-a98f-60ebcadf7260` |\n"
"| Pay-As-You-Go | `5304b575-3cff-4455-90dc-ae4367762093` |\n"
"| Open | `850b21a7-71de-4e53-9441-1abdd202f35d` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each result includes the same `extensions` field as described in [Get an instance](#get-an-instance).\n"
msgstr "Setiap hasil mencakup field `extensions` yang sama seperti yang dijelaskan di [Mendapatkan sebuah instance](#get-an-instance).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request GET \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances?resource_id=b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
