#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an instance {#update-an-instance}"
msgstr "Memperbarui sebuah instance {#update-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`PATCH /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance) endpoint to update the limit, allocation, and permitted backends for an instance. The [CRN](/guides/instances) must be URL-encoded in the path.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan endpoint [`PATCH /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance) untuk memperbarui batas, alokasi, dan Backend yang diizinkan untuk sebuah instance. [CRN](/guides/instances) harus di-URL-encode dalam path.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass a `parameters` JSON object in the request body with the fields you want to change, along with the header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`. Omitted fields are left unchanged.\n"
msgstr "Teruskan objek JSON `parameters` di body permintaan dengan field yang ingin kamu ubah, beserta header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`. Field yang dihilangkan tetap tidak berubah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The time allocated to this instance, used by the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) to determine queue priority. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits). Not applicable to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, atau `null`. Waktu yang dialokasikan untuk instance ini, digunakan oleh [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) untuk menentukan prioritas antrean. Lihat [Menetapkan batas alokasi instance](/guides/allocation-limits). Tidak berlaku untuk instance Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backends` — Array of strings. The allowlist of backend names available to this instance. `[\"ANY\"]` means all backends on the plan are available. `[]` means no backends are available.\n"
msgstr "`backends` — Array berisi string. Daftar izin nama Backend yang tersedia untuk instance ini. `[\"ANY\"]` berarti semua Backend pada paket tersedia. `[]` berarti tidak ada Backend yang tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Always include a unique timestamp\">\n"
"  The API silently ignores the request if `parameters` is identical to the previous request. In the `parameters` object, always include a `timestamp` field set to the current time so each request is treated as unique.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Selalu sertakan timestamp unik\">\n"
"  API akan diam-diam mengabaikan permintaan jika `parameters` identik dengan permintaan sebelumnya. Dalam objek `parameters`, selalu sertakan field `timestamp` yang ditetapkan ke waktu saat ini agar setiap permintaan diperlakukan sebagai unik.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The endpoint's response is similar to [getting an instance](#get-an-instance), including how it handles the `extensions` object.\n"
msgstr "Respons endpoint ini mirip dengan [mendapatkan sebuah instance](#get-an-instance), termasuk bagaimana ia menangani objek `extensions`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    --request PATCH \\\n"
"    --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"    --data \"{\n"
"        \\\"parameters\\\": {\n"
"            \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"$(date -u +\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\\\",\n"
"            \\\"usage_allocation_seconds\\\": 220\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\"\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import urllib.parse\n"
"    import datetime\n"
"    import requests\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timestamp = datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\n"
"    body = {\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    timestamp = datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\n"
"    body = {\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.patch(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.patch(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new instance {#create-a-new-instance}"
msgstr "Membuat instance baru {#create-a-new-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`POST /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance) endpoint to create (provision) a new instance. Pass a JSON body with the header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan endpoint [`POST /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance) untuk membuat (menyediakan) instance baru. Teruskan body JSON dengan header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required fields:\n"
msgstr "Field yang wajib:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`name` — A human-readable name for the instance.\n"
msgstr "`name` — Nama yang mudah dibaca manusia untuk instance tersebut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`target` — The region, such as `us-east` or `eu-de`.\n"
msgstr "`target` — Region, seperti `us-east` atau `eu-de`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`resource_plan_id` — The plan for this instance. See the [plan ID table](#get-a-list-of-all-instances).\n"
msgstr "`resource_plan_id` — Paket untuk instance ini. Lihat [tabel ID paket](#get-a-list-of-all-instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`resource_group` — The [resource group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs) to use.\n"
msgstr "`resource_group` — [Resource group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs) yang akan digunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also include a `parameters` object to set quantum-specific values:\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa menyertakan objek `parameters` untuk menetapkan nilai khusus kuantum:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request POST \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"      --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"      --data '{\n"
"          \"name\": \"my-new-instance\",\n"
"          \"target\": \"us-east\",\n"
"          \"resource_plan_id\": \"7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc\",\n"
"          \"resource_group\": \"<YOUR_RESOURCE_GROUP_ID>\",\n"
"          \"parameters\": {\n"
"              \"instance_limit_seconds\": 300,\n"
"              \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220\n"
"          }\n"
"      }'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    body = {\n"
"        \"name\": \"my-new-instance\",\n"
"        \"target\": \"us-east\",\n"
"        \"resource_plan_id\": \"7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc\",\n"
"        \"resource_group\": \"<YOUR_RESOURCE_GROUP_ID>\",\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"instance_limit_seconds\": 300,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    body = {\n"
"        \"name\": \"my-new-instance\",\n"
"        \"target\": \"us-east\",\n"
"        \"resource_plan_id\": \"7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc\",\n"
"        \"resource_group\": \"<YOUR_RESOURCE_GROUP_ID>\",\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"instance_limit_seconds\": 300,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.post(\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances\",\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.post(\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances\",\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"functions-api\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Qiskit Functions access on an instance {#configure-qiskit-functions-access-on-an-instance}"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi akses Qiskit Functions pada sebuah instance {#configure-qiskit-functions-access-on-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use these instructions to configure Qiskit Functions access on an existing IBM Quantum Compute Service instance by using the IBM Cloud Resource Controller API.  Follow the instructions in order, as the commands build on each other.  For example, variables such as the token and URL are set in one step and reused in later steps. \n"
msgstr "Gunakan instruksi berikut untuk mengonfigurasi akses Qiskit Functions pada instance IBM Quantum Compute Service yang sudah ada dengan menggunakan IBM Cloud Resource Controller API. Ikuti instruksi secara berurutan, karena setiap perintah dibangun berdasarkan perintah sebelumnya. Misalnya, variabel seperti token dan URL ditetapkan pada satu langkah dan digunakan kembali pada langkah-langkah berikutnya. \n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Cloud API key (also called a token).  If necessary, create your API key on the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). \n"
msgstr "Sebuah IBM Cloud API key (juga disebut token). Jika perlu, buat API key-mu di [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). \n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The CRN of the instance you want to configure.  The instance's CRN is listed on your [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr "CRN dari instance yang ingin kamu konfigurasikan. CRN instance tercantum di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) milikmu.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Get a bearer token {#step-1-get-a-bearer-token}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Dapatkan bearer token {#step-1-get-a-bearer-token}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exchange your API key for a bearer token. You will pass this token in the authorization header of all resource controller requests. Run the following code to generate a bearer token:\n"
msgstr "Tukarkan API key-mu dengan bearer token. Kamu akan meneruskan token ini di header otorisasi dari semua permintaan resource controller. Jalankan kode berikut untuk menghasilkan bearer token:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request POST \\\n"
"  --url 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"  --header 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"  --data 'apikey=<YOUR_API_KEY>&grant_type=urn%3Aibm%3Aparams%3Aoauth%3Agrant-type%3Aapikey'\n"
"  --silent | jq .\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"import requests\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "api_key = \"<YOUR_API_KEY>\"\n"
msgstr "api_key = \"<YOUR_API_KEY>\"\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.post(\n"
"    \"https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token\",\n"
"    headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"},\n"
"    params={\n"
"        \"apikey\": api_key,\n"
"        \"grant_type\": \"urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"token = resp.json()[\"access_token\"]\n"
"print(token) \n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.post(\n"
"    \"https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token\",\n"
"    headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"},\n"
"    params={\n"
"        \"apikey\": api_key,\n"
"        \"grant_type\": \"urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"token = resp.json()[\"access_token\"]\n"
"print(token) \n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The response includes an `access_token` field, which is your bearer token. Copy this value.\n"
msgstr "Respons mencakup field `access_token`, yang merupakan bearer token-mu. Salin nilai ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Verify access {#step-2-verify-access}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Verifikasi akses {#step-2-verify-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before making any changes, confirm that your token works and inspect the current instance configuration.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum melakukan perubahan apa pun, pastikan token-mu berfungsi dan periksa konfigurasi instance saat ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Important\">\n"
"The CRN must be manually URL-encoded in the path. Replace each `:` with `%3A` and each `/` with `%2F`. For example, `crn:v1:bluemix:...` becomes `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Penting\">\n"
"CRN harus di-URL-encode secara manual dalam path. Ganti setiap `:` dengan `%3A` dan setiap `/` dengan `%2F`. Misalnya, `crn:v1:bluemix:...` menjadi `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request GET \\\n"
"  --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"import urllib.parse\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
msgstr "crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "The CRN will be URL-encoded into the path."
msgstr "CRN akan di-URL-encode ke dalam path."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"instance_url = (\n"
"    \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"    + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
")\n"
"headers = {\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n"
msgstr ""
"instance_url = (\n"
"    \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"    + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
")\n"
"headers = {\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.get(instance_url, headers=headers, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.get(instance_url, headers=headers, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `200 OK` response confirms that your token is valid. The current instance configuration is in the extensions field of the response. Use this instead of parameters, which might be stale.\n"
msgstr "Respons `200 OK` memastikan bahwa token-mu valid. Konfigurasi instance saat ini ada di field extensions pada respons tersebut. Gunakan ini alih-alih parameters, yang mungkin sudah usang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"step-3\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Look up the account-level functions configuration {#step-3-look-up-the-account-level-functions-configuration}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Cari konfigurasi functions tingkat akun {#step-3-look-up-the-account-level-functions-configuration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An instance can only be granted access to what the account is entitled to. Before configuring the instance, look up the account's configuration so you know which functions, business models, and permissions are available to grant. This is the source of truth for the values you will send in Step 4.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah instance hanya bisa diberi akses ke apa yang berhak dimiliki akun tersebut. Sebelum mengonfigurasi instance, cari konfigurasi akun sehingga kamu tahu functions, model bisnis, dan izin mana yang tersedia untuk diberikan. Ini adalah sumber kebenaran untuk nilai yang akan kamu kirim pada Langkah 4.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call `GET /accounts/{id}` on the Qiskit Runtime API with your API key. The `{id}` is your account ID without the `a/` prefix.  You can find it from the instance CRN (`crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:...:a/<ACCOUNT_ID>:...`).\n"
msgstr "Panggil `GET /accounts/{id}` pada Qiskit Runtime API dengan API key-mu. `{id}` adalah ID akunmu tanpa prefix `a/`. Kamu bisa menemukannya dari CRN instance (`crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:...:a/<ACCOUNT_ID>:...`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request GET \\\n"
"  --url 'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/accounts/<ACCOUNT_ID>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: apikey <YOUR_API_KEY>'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"account_id = \"<ACCOUNT_ID>\"  # from the CRN: crn:...:a/<ACCOUNT_ID>:...\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.get(\n"
"    f\"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/accounts/{account_id}\",\n"
"    headers={\"Authorization\": f\"apikey {api_key}\"},\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"for plan in resp.json()[\"plans\"]:\n"
"    print(plan[\"plan_id\"], plan.get(\"functions\"), plan.get(\"custom_functions\"))\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.get(\n"
"    f\"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/accounts/{account_id}\",\n"
"    headers={\"Authorization\": f\"apikey {api_key}\"},\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"for plan in resp.json()[\"plans\"]:\n"
"    print(plan[\"plan_id\"], plan.get(\"functions\"), plan.get(\"custom_functions\"))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each plan in the response includes a functions array and, if configured, a `custom_functions` object. These list the exact name, provider, business model, and permissions values you can grant to an instance under that plan.\n"
msgstr "Setiap paket dalam respons mencakup array functions dan, jika dikonfigurasi, sebuah objek `custom_functions`. Ini mencantumkan nama persis, provider, model bisnis, dan nilai izin yang bisa kamu berikan ke sebuah instance di bawah paket tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"`GET /accounts/{id}` shows what is available to grant at the account level. `GET /functions` (see [Verify the result](#verify-result)) shows what a specific instance has already been granted. Use the **account** endpoint to discover valid values, and the **functions** endpoint to confirm the result.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Configure functions access {#step-4-configure-functions-access}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Konfigurasikan akses functions {#step-4-configure-functions-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the instance to grant access to Catalog Functions and Custom Functions.\n"
msgstr "Perbarui instance untuk memberikan akses ke Catalog Functions dan Custom Functions.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Important notes\">\n"
"- The `name`, `provider`, and `business_model` values in functions must exactly match entries configured at the account level (see the [previous step](#step-3)). Permissions must be a non-empty subset of the account's permissions for that function. Similarly, `custom_functions.permissions` must be a non-empty subset of the account's `custom_functions` permissions.\n"
"- Include a timestamp in parameters on every PATCH. The Resource Controller deduplicates PATCH requests by comparing incoming parameters to the last value it stored. If they match, the request is silently dropped with `200 OK` without reaching the service. Include a changing timestamp value to prevent this.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan penting\">\n"
"- Nilai `name`, `provider`, dan `business_model` pada functions harus persis cocok dengan entri yang dikonfigurasi pada tingkat akun (lihat [langkah sebelumnya](#step-3)). Permissions harus berupa subset yang tidak kosong dari izin akun untuk fungsi tersebut. Demikian pula, `custom_functions.permissions` harus berupa subset yang tidak kosong dari izin `custom_functions` akun.\n"
"- Sertakan timestamp dalam parameters pada setiap PATCH. Resource Controller menghilangkan duplikasi permintaan PATCH dengan membandingkan parameters yang masuk dengan nilai terakhir yang tersimpan. Jika cocok, permintaan tersebut akan diam-diam dibatalkan dengan `200 OK` tanpa mencapai layanan. Sertakan nilai timestamp yang berubah untuk mencegah hal ini.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request PATCH \\\n"
"  --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"  --data '{\n"
"    \"parameters\": {\n"
"      \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\n"
"      \"functions\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"          \"name\": \"<FUNCTION_NAME>\",\n"
"          \"provider\": \"<PROVIDER>\",\n"
"          \"business_model\": \"<BUSINESS_MODEL>\",\n"
"          \"permissions\": [\n"
"            \"function.read\",\n"
"            \"function.run\",\n"
"            \"function-files.read\",\n"
"            \"function-files.write\"\n"
"          ]\n"
"        }\n"
"      ],\n"
"      \"custom_functions\": {\n"
"        \"permissions\": [\n"
"          \"function-custom.write\",\n"
"          \"function-custom.run\"\n"
"        ]\n"
"      }\n"
"    }\n"
"  }'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"from datetime import datetime, timezone\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "A changing timestamp keeps the Resource Controller from de-duplicating the request."
msgstr "Timestamp yang berubah mencegah Resource Controller menghilangkan duplikasi permintaan."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"_now = datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n"
"timestamp = _now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.\") + f\"{_now.microsecond:06d}000Z\"\n"
msgstr ""
"_now = datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n"
"timestamp = _now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.\") + f\"{_now.microsecond:06d}000Z\"\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"body = {\n"
"    \"parameters\": {\n"
"        \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"        \"functions\": [\n"
"            {\n"
"                \"name\": \"<FUNCTION_NAME>\",\n"
"                \"provider\": \"<PROVIDER>\",\n"
"                \"business_model\": \"<BUSINESS_MODEL>\",\n"
"                \"permissions\": [\n"
"                    \"function.read\",\n"
"                    \"function.run\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.read\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.write\",\n"
"                ],\n"
"            }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"custom_functions\": {\n"
"            \"permissions\": [\"function-custom.write\", \"function-custom.run\"],\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"body = {\n"
"    \"parameters\": {\n"
"        \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"        \"functions\": [\n"
"            {\n"
"                \"name\": \"<FUNCTION_NAME>\",\n"
"                \"provider\": \"<PROVIDER>\",\n"
"                \"business_model\": \"<BUSINESS_MODEL>\",\n"
"                \"permissions\": [\n"
"                    \"function.read\",\n"
"                    \"function.run\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.read\",\n"
"                    \"function-files.write\",\n"
"                ],\n"
"            }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"custom_functions\": {\n"
"            \"permissions\": [\"function-custom.write\", \"function-custom.run\"],\n"
"        },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json()[\"extensions\"])\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `200 OK` response indicates success. The updated configuration appears in the extensions field of the response.\n"
msgstr "Respons `200 OK` menandakan keberhasilan. Konfigurasi yang diperbarui muncul di field extensions pada respons tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove functions access {#remove-functions-access}"
msgstr "Menghapus akses functions {#remove-functions-access}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Catalog Functions {#catalog-functions}"
msgstr "Catalog Functions {#catalog-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove Catalog Functions from an instance, send a PATCH with `\"functions\": null`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus Catalog Functions dari sebuah instance, kirim PATCH dengan `\"functions\": null`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"--data '{\n"
"  \"parameters\": {\n"
"    \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T00:00:01Z\",\n"
"    \"functions\": null\n"
"  }\n"
"}'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"body = {\"parameters\": {\"timestamp\": timestamp, \"functions\": None}}\n"
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting `\"functions\": []` (an empty array) equivalently clears Catalog Functions. `null` is the canonical form.\n"
msgstr "Menetapkan `\"functions\": []` (array kosong) secara setara menghapus Catalog Functions. `null` adalah bentuk kanonik.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Functions {#custom-functions}"
msgstr "Custom Functions {#custom-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove Custom Functions from an instance, send a PATCH with `\"custom_functions\": null`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus Custom Functions dari sebuah instance, kirim PATCH dengan `\"custom_functions\": null`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"--data '{\n"
"  \"parameters\": {\n"
"    \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T00:00:02Z\",\n"
"    \"custom_functions\": null\n"
"  }\n"
"}'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"body = {\"parameters\": {\"timestamp\": timestamp, \"custom_functions\": None}}\n"
"resp = requests.patch(instance_url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=30)\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting `\"custom_functions\": {\"permissions\": []}` equivalently clears custom functions. `null` is the canonical form.\n"
msgstr "Menetapkan `\"custom_functions\": {\"permissions\": []}` secara setara menghapus custom functions. `null` adalah bentuk kanonik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"verify-result\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify the result {#verify-the-result}"
msgstr "Verifikasi hasilnya {#verify-the-result}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To confirm that the instance has the correct Qiskit Functions configuration, use `GET /functions` from the Qiskit Runtime API instead of the Resource Controller. The Resource Controller's stored state might be stale if account-level changes updated the instance outside of the Resource Controller.\n"
msgstr "Untuk memastikan bahwa instance memiliki konfigurasi Qiskit Functions yang benar, gunakan `GET /functions` dari Qiskit Runtime API alih-alih Resource Controller. Status tersimpan Resource Controller mungkin sudah usang jika perubahan tingkat akun memperbarui instance di luar Resource Controller.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"curl --request GET \\\n"
"  --url 'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/functions' \\\n"
"  --header 'Authorization: apikey <YOUR_API_KEY>' \\\n"
"  --header 'Service-CRN: <YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    ```python\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Service-CRN header takes the raw CRN, not the URL-encoded form."
msgstr "Header Service-CRN menggunakan CRN mentah, bukan bentuk yang di-URL-encode."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resp = requests.get(\n"
"    \"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/functions\",\n"
"    headers={\"Authorization\": f\"apikey {api_key}\", \"Service-CRN\": crn},\n"
"    timeout=30,\n"
")\n"
"resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"resp = requests.get(\n"
"    \"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/functions\",\n"
